        "id": 225465,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-02-05T00:28:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I usually end up flipping the Blight card, which oddly takes a lot of pressure off as you get a big infusion of blight usually when you need it.</p>\n<p>Generally, I lose to blight. Don't think I've ever run out the Invader deck, which is another option for loss, and definitely haven't had anyone run out of presence before.</p>\n<p>One thing I heard someone say recently is that victory and defeat in Spirit Island dovetail, which is why sometimes a win can feel anticlimactic, when you're so close to destruction and suddenly realize, oh! That's it, then!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:07.458Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
