        "created_at": "2019-02-05T15:58:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've only ever lost to Blight, but I've been down to the last card or two in the Invader deck a couple of times. Never lost via a spirit running out of Presence but it came very close once when we got the \"destroy a bunch of Presence on each board\" Blight card (Tipping Point?) and I think that left me with only one Presence on the entire island. I think that was the same game where we had the \"Destroy Presence or add Blight\" Event the following turn, which was SO HELPFUL :P.</p>",
